<section class="match-game" data-match-game aria-labelledby="match-game-title">
  <div class="match-game__head">
    <div>
      <p class="kicker">GAME 02 / ATTENTION MATCH</p>
      <h2 id="match-game-title" class="match-game__title">Token 注意力配对</h2>
      <p class="match-game__intro">翻开两张卡，找出语义相关的一对。配对成功会亮起一条注意力线。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="match-game__meta">
      <span class="tag">60 秒</span>
      <span class="tag">12 张卡</span>
      <span class="tag">记忆 + 联想</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="match-game__stage">
    <div class="match-game__start" data-match-start>
      <p class="label">HOW TO PLAY / 怎么玩</p>
      <h3>找一对，<br />再找下一对。</h3>
      <p>
        棋盘上有 6 对语义相关的词卡，例如「过拟合」和「正则化」、「RAG」和「检索」。每次翻开两张：
        配对成功会保留并画出一条注意力线；配对失败会自动盖回去。
      </p>
      <p class="match-game__rules">60 秒内完成全部 6 对。配对越快，时间奖励越高。</p>
      <button class="btn btn--solid match-game__start-btn" type="button" data-match-begin>
        <span>开始配对</span><span class="btn__arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
      </button>
    </div>

    <div class="match-game__play" data-match-play hidden>
      <div class="match-game__bar">
        <span>配对 <strong data-match-pairs>0 / 6</strong></span>
        <span>时间 <strong data-match-time>60</strong>s</span>
        <span>得分 <strong data-match-score>0</strong></span>
      </div>

      <div class="match-game__board-wrap">
        <svg class="match-game__lines" data-match-lines aria-hidden="true"></svg>
        <div class="match-game__board" data-match-board></div>
      </div>

      <p class="match-game__status" data-match-status aria-live="polite">翻开两张卡，找语义相关的一对。</p>
    </div>

    <div class="match-game__result" data-match-result hidden aria-live="polite">
      <p class="label" data-match-result-label>RESULT / 时间到</p>
      <p class="match-game__result-score" data-match-result-score>0</p>
      <h3 data-match-result-title>配对结束</h3>
      <p data-match-result-note></p>
      <div class="match-game__result-actions">
        <button class="btn btn--solid" type="button" data-match-replay><span>再玩一次</span><span class="btn__arrow" aria-hidden="true">↻</span></button>
        <a class="btn" href="#ai-or-human"><span>去玩 AI 判断</span><span class="btn__arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  import '../scripts/token-match.js';
</script>

